sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GitHub
    participant Docker
    participant Compose as DockerCompose
    participant Services

    User->>GitHub: git clone repository
    GitHub-->>User: source code
    User->>Docker: docker login nvcr.io
    Docker-->>User: login success
    User->>Compose: docker compose up --build
    Compose->>Services: build and start containers
    Services-->>Compose: health ready
    Compose-->>User: stack ready
    User->>Services: run client requests
